{"t":"Fire Bug","s":"fire-bug-7f2c5","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Fire_Bug_ff3290.gif","q":14,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Fire Bug</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Fire Bug\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fire_Bug_ff3290.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Tools and other Equipment<br/>Tools</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pickupable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickupable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"weight\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Weight</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">30.50 oz</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stackable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Stackable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">100 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not bought by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">100 gp</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lightcolor\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Light</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"colorbox\" style=\"background-color: #ffcc33; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: inline-block;\"></span><span style=\"margin: 0 0 0 0.4em;\">3 sqm</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Utility Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7.8<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">August 1, 2006<br/>Summer Update 2006</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20070830120831&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fire_Bug_ff3290.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a fire bug.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 30.50 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">This strange creature has the tendency to set certain things on fire.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\nThis tool is used for burning <a href=\"#/wiki/Sugar%20Cane\">Sugar Cane</a> fields before harvesting them to make <a href=\"#/wiki/Rum\">Rum</a>. It will sometimes explode upon use, causing 5 damage to the user and being destroyed in the process. Also provides 3 squares of permanent yellow light and can light up <a href=\"#/wiki/Empty%20Coal%20Basin\">Empty Coal Basins</a>. Also, when you use it successfully, it won't necessarily disappear. So it's possible to use the same fire bug multiple times. Moreover, it doesn't seem to be able to explode during quests (like <a href=\"#/quest/machinery-of-war-quest\">Machinery of War Quest</a>).<p>\nEach fire bug can burn around 20 fields of sugar cane based on a test done by a player in which he bought 100 bugs and managed to burn 2011 fields.\nThis item is also used in the <a href=\"#/quest/the-shattered-isles-quest\">Meriana Quest</a>, <a href=\"#/quest/dreamers-challenge-quest\">Dreamer's Challenge Quest</a>, <a href=\"#/quest/treasure-hunt-quest\">Treasure Hunt Quest</a>, <a href=\"#/quest/machinery-of-war-quest\">Machinery of War Quest</a>, <a href=\"#/quest/tower-defence-quest\">Tower Defence Quest</a>, <a href=\"#/quest/secret-service-quest\">Secret Service Quest</a> (For TBI), <a href=\"#/quest/blood-brothers-quest\">Blood Brothers Quest</a>, and <a href=\"#/quest/kissing-a-pig-quest\">Kissing a Pig Quest</a>.</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-buyfrom\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><table class=\"wikitable sortable\"><tbody><tr><th>NPC</th><th>Location</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Evan\">Evan</a></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Liberty%20Bay\">Liberty Bay</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">100 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headlin